 "about": [
  "Every file the baggage belt draws as a carrier wordmark (each IATA_TO_WORDMARK entry through wordmarkSrc, light and dark cuts), read by _wmLineProfile in fids-current/js/fids-core.js in Chrome on v24003.",
  "w, h: the canvas the art is drawn on, 100 rows tall and as wide as the art is for that height.",
  "n, s (art narrower than 4:1 only; wider art is never read): per row, the pixels that carry ink (alpha over 64), and the pixels from the first ink to the last.",
  "To read them again: boot bids.html, and for each file load it into an Image and call _wmLineProfile(image)."
 ],
